{"3877830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beachside Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 3877830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own dessert restaurant in a French beach town! Cook crepes, waffles, ice cream and more. Serve tourists and locals, and expand your menu. Manage supplies, hire employees, upgrade your equipment, and grow your space to build your dream seaside dessert spot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Delicious Desserts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook French seaside desserts like crêpes, waffles, ice cream, or beignets through fun mini-games. Master recipes, experiment with toppings, and unlock new sweets to expand your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders and serve desserts to locals and tourists. Deliver fast and efficient attentive service to satisfy your customers and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Restaurant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your restaurant running by ordering and organizing supplies. Hire employees and coordinate your team to help you ensure efficient service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand &amp; Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your restaurant by unlocking new areas. Gain access to new cooking equipment and customize your space with decorations as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own dessert restaurant in a French beach town! Cook crepes, waffles, ice cream and more. Serve tourists and locals, and expand your menu. Manage supplies, hire employees, upgrade your equipment, and grow your space to build your dream seaside dessert spot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Delicious Desserts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook French seaside desserts like crêpes, waffles, ice cream, or beignets through fun mini-games. Master recipes, experiment with toppings, and unlock new sweets to expand your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/153f41f9c97362f7824f61d2d738e9df.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders and serve desserts to locals and tourists. Deliver fast and efficient attentive service to satisfy your customers and build your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/904f254f5d598d75b9594db1be7e5095.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Restaurant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your restaurant running by ordering and organizing supplies. Hire employees and coordinate your team to help you ensure efficient service.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/f65f4484b02ef3d06e97d5c20bf3b8d1.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand &amp; Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your restaurant by unlocking new areas. Gain access to new cooking equipment and customize your space with decorations as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.poster.avif?t=1787416950\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.webm?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877830/extras/67925c978f6bd676294ee8b44dda6db4.mp4?t=1787416950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Run your own dessert restaurant in a French beach town! Cook crepes, waffl